{"timestamp": 1779431816.4169264, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 16, "data": {"caller": "player_2", "reason": "Charlie reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "weapons", "victim_name": "Bob"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779431816.4182312, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 16, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431825.8318996, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I just found Bob dead in weapons. My route this round was storage, then medbay, electrical, security, and finally into weapons where I found the body. \n\nEarly in the round, I was in medbay and saw Frank there with me for a bit, so Frank is clear for the very beginning at least. After I left medbay, I didn't run into anyone else through electrical or security. Since I came up from the south, whoever killed Bob either vented or left heading west towards the cafeteria before I got there. \n\nDid anyone see someone near weapons or the cafeteria recently? Frank, who did you run into after we parted ways?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431835.2261844, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started in the cafeteria, then went to oxygen, upper engine, and finally lower engine. \n\nCharlie, to answer your question about Frank: I can vouch for him for a huge chunk of the round. I saw Frank enter upper engine from medbay pretty early on, and then he was with me in lower engine until just before the meeting was called. At the very end, Frank headed towards storage, and right as he left, Eve came into lower engine from storage. \n\nSince Bob died over in weapons on the right side of the map, and I was with Frank on the complete opposite side for almost the whole round, I'm pretty sure Frank is clear. Eve was also on the bottom left near storage at the end. That leaves Diana completely unaccounted for on my end. Diana, where were you this round?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431847.0887532, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I can completely confirm both Charlie and Alice's stories. I started in Electrical, moved to Medbay where I saw Charlie early on (he came up from Storage). After that, I headed west through Upper Engine and down to Lower Engine. I was with Alice in Lower Engine for the second half of the round, and right before the meeting was called, Eve walked in from Storage. \n\nSo Alice, Eve, and I were all clustered on the far west/bottom-left side of the ship. With Bob dead in Weapons on the complete opposite side, that leaves Diana as the only person unaccounted for. Diana, we really need to hear your exact route this round. Unless Charlie is pulling a clever self-report, all signs are pointing to you right now."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431870.9830635, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I was on the right side early, so I can add to that. I started around Weapons doing the weapons task and Bob was alive there at the beginning \u2014 he came in from Security and was standing on the task area. I left him alive and went through Security, and the only person I saw on that side after that was Diana in Security.\n\nAfter that I went down through Navigation, crossed Storage, and ended in Lower Engine where Alice and Frank saw me. So I definitely wasn\u2019t near Weapons when the body was found.\n\nGiven Charlie found Bob in Weapons, and Alice/Frank can place themselves with each other on the left, Diana is the only one I saw near that area after Bob was alive. Diana, what were you doing in Security and where did you go after?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431893.940437, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Hold on, everyone. I know it looks bad for me because I was alone on the right side of the map for most of the round, but Charlie's story has a massive, undeniable hole in it.\n\nMy exact route this round was Navigation, up to Security, then west through Electrical, and finally into Medbay. \n\nEve, I can totally back up your story. I saw you enter Security coming from Weapons early on (around tick 6), which matches you leaving Bob alive there. \n\nBut Charlie, here's where you get caught. You claim your route was Medbay -> Electrical -> Security -> Weapons. I was walking that EXACT same corridor in the opposite direction (Security -> Electrical -> Medbay). If you actually took that path, we absolutely would have crossed paths or I would have seen you in either Electrical or Security. But I never saw you a single time this round. \n\nCharlie is completely lying about his route to justify being in Weapons to \"find\" the body. It\u2019s a self-report. Since Alice and Frank are hard-clearing each other on the left side, and Eve is cleared by them at the end, Charlie is the only one who could have done this. \n\nI'm voting Charlie, and you all should too if we want to win this."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431904.9784932, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Diana"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431919.8391757, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Diana"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431930.2251244, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Diana"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431943.712602, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "Diana, that doesn\u2019t clear you at all \u2014 it actually lines up with what I saw.\n\nI left Bob alive in Weapons, went into Security, and saw you there right after. Then I went down through Navigation/Storage to Lower Engine, where Alice and Frank saw me at the end. I never saw Charlie on that side, but I also wasn\u2019t sitting in Security the whole time watching every hallway.\n\nYour \u201cwe would have crossed paths\u201d argument depends on exact timing, and the corridors are long enough that you could easily miss Charlie if he came through after you left. What\u2019s solid is: Bob was alive in Weapons, I saw you nearby in Security afterward, and everyone else has people placing them away from Weapons later.\n\nI\u2019m with the others here \u2014 this is Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431957.8551333, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 16, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I can see you've all made up your minds, but you are making a massive mistake. Eve, think about it logically \u2014 if Charlie took the exact path he claimed (Medbay -> Electrical -> Security -> Weapons) while I was moving Security -> Electrical -> Medbay, we would have collided. The corridors are long, yes, but that means we spend *more* time in them, making it impossible for us to completely phase through each other unseen. \n\nCharlie is using the fact that I was alone on the right side to frame me for his self-report. Since you're all locking your votes on me, I probably can't stop this ejection. But when you vote me out and the game doesn't end because I'm an innocent Goose, you need to avenge me and vote Charlie out immediately next round. Don't let him talk his way out of it tomorrow. Good luck, Geese."}}
